@startuml
title AI Processing Layer Component Diagram

package "AI Processing Layer" {
    [Agents-api] as AgentsAPI
    [LLM Service (Watsonx)] as LLM
    [RAG Connector Service] as RAG
    [Rule-Based Engine (future use)] as RuleEngine
}

AgentsAPI --> LLM : Calls for log explanation, classification
AgentsAPI --> RAG : Queries knowledge base for context
AgentsAPI --> RuleEngine : Evaluates rules for alerts
@enduml
